What is your source of that gratitude?

00:33:13.200 --> 00:33:17.160
- My sources that I was
extremely fortunate with

00:33:17.160 --> 00:33:18.750
the luck of the DNA game

00:33:18.750 --> 00:33:20.530
and outrageous levels

00:33:20.530 --> 00:33:22.650
