00:33:22.650 --> 00:33:24.403
That's me, that's me.

00:33:25.893 --> 00:33:27.860
That's why I stand up here today,

00:33:27.860 --> 00:33:29.360
not thinking anything of me,

00:33:29.360 --> 00:33:31.060
all this things that I'm spewing,

00:33:31.060 --> 00:33:32.480
