00:33:32.480 --> 00:33:33.450
what my mom gave to me

00:33:33.450 --> 00:33:35.200
and I'm sure she got, you know, like,

00:33:35.200 --> 00:33:37.660
I don't think there's
anything special about me,

00:33:37.660 --> 00:33:40.350
I know what I'm saying
is special and important.

00:33:40.350 --> 00:33:42.800
I know a lot of other
people know it to be true.

00:33:42.800 --> 00:33:46.330
I have so much judgment on me in the world

00:33:46.330 --> 00:33:49.860
because I am obsessed with
talking about positive things

00:33:49.860 --> 00:33:52.750
in a world where anger
and darkness is loud

00:33:52.750 --> 00:33:54.123
