00:34:38.210 --> 00:34:41.580
Her and my dad escaped communist
Poland back in the '80s,

00:34:41.580 --> 00:34:44.550
created this unbelievable
life here in Canada.

00:34:44.550 --> 00:34:46.490
And I remember listening
to you on a podcast,

00:34:46.490 --> 00:34:47.660
I think maybe the moment

00:34:47.660 --> 00:34:48.627
where I truly fell in love with Gary Vee,

00:34:48.627 --> 00:34:50.320
