This macro prosperity is
the foundation of anxiety.

00:35:05.800 --> 00:35:08.260
You don't worry about everything
we talk about in society

00:35:08.260 --> 00:35:09.510
when you don't have food.

00:35:10.840 --> 00:35:12.290
- Gary, did you ever have anxiety?

00:35:12.290 --> 00:35:13.780
Did you ever put these
pressures on yourself

00:35:13.780 --> 00:35:16.050
