00:35:20.100 --> 00:35:21.850
how did you get out of that bubble?

00:35:23.080 --> 00:35:25.560
- The most insecure
place I've ever been in

00:35:25.560 --> 00:35:28.640
was the fear of confrontation,

00:35:28.640 --> 00:35:30.610
which blows people's mind

00:35:30.610 --> 00:35:34.440
because on stage and public persona,

00:35:34.440 --> 00:35:35.913
candor is my strength,

00:35:36.810 --> 00:35:40.020
but real life, I hated candor

00:35:40.020 --> 00:35:43.230
because my father was very
aggressive with candor,

00:35:43.230 --> 00:35:44.910
but very negative.

00:35:44.910 --> 00:35:47.080
And I wasn't able to separate the vehicle

00:35:47.080 --> 00:35:48.840
he was deploying the candor in

00:35:48.840 --> 00:35:50.520
from the value of candor.

00:35:50.520 --> 00:35:53.220
So, for 25 years of my
career, I was anxious

00:35:53.220 --> 00:35:55.370
every time I decided
somebody had to get fired,

00:35:55.370 --> 00:35:57.600
it completely put me into spirals.

00:35:57.600 --> 00:35:59.953
I would avoid it, it was always sloppy.

00:36:02.090 --> 00:36:04.160
To a T, every person that's
ever been close to me

00:36:04.160 --> 00:36:07.600
in business that works
for me or worked for me

00:36:07.600 --> 00:36:10.370
that doesn't love me
is based on one thing,

00:36:10.370 --> 00:36:12.201
my inability to be candorous.

00:36:12.201 --> 00:36:13.100
And it's been a very big shift for me

00:36:13.100 --> 00:36:14.110
in the last three, four years,

00:36:14.110 --> 00:36:16.440
the new book is called
"Twelve and a Half",

00:36:16.440 --> 00:36:18.920
it's about 13 attributes,

00:36:18.920 --> 00:36:20.800
but I call it "Twelve and a Half" because

00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:23.660
I'm only halfway through
my journey on kind candor.

00:36:23.660 --> 00:36:26.300
And I needed to create the
word kind in front of candor

00:36:26.300 --> 00:36:28.020
to even begin to deploy candor,

00:36:28.020 --> 00:36:30.570
and it has led to an incredible
amount of unhappiness

00:36:30.570 --> 00:36:32.430
in my life and career

00:36:32.430 --> 00:36:33.740
was my inability to be candarous,

00:36:33.740 --> 00:36:37.040
which is wild 'cause my
content is incredibly candarous

00:36:37.040 --> 00:36:39.050
'cause I'm not talking to anybody,

00:36:39.050 --> 00:36:40.680
I'm talking to everybody,

00:36:40.680 --> 00:36:44.390
but when it's Steve or Sally
or Johnny or Nicole or Karen,

00:36:44.390 --> 00:36:46.120
it was very hard for me.

00:36:46.120 --> 00:36:48.143
And so now I do it.

